  "takeaways": [
    "External directory mounting and virtual-path notification deduplication, not content duplicate discovery; no production source port justified.",
    "Preserve explicit incomplete/error outcomes through the scan caller. A bounded scan is not a complete result, and a swallowed metadata error must not become an unqualified success.",
    "Use coherent stateful read-after-write tests for persistent state. Independent read/write mocks can miss target-file replacement and partial rollback.",
    "Keep snapshot/revision guards and per-owner cancellation distinct from atomic persistence, file identity and live-backend correctness.",
    "Binary subview boundaries matter: isolated S3 readBinary exposed backing-array extra bytes; WebDAV/SFTP controls retained slicing. Provider occurrence unqualified."
  ],
